{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[D]How could I sit here in [Bm/D]silence,
Knowing the love that you've [A]given [G]me?
My heart [D]sings
[D]Your mercies made new every [Bm/D]morning,
Your grace brings to me over[A]flowing [G]peace,
My heart [D]sings
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Pre-Chorus}
[Asus]You've given [Gsus]everything I need,
[Asus]The least I can [Gsus]do is to offer [D]me
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[D]Take my [A]heart, show me the [G]way
To fol[Em7]low you each [Bm7]day
Take my [A]life and let it [G]be
To you an offer[D]ing
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[D]How could I question your power
When your creation [A]shouts to [G]me?
My heart [D]sings
[D]The heavens whisper of your wonder,
Your voice is [G]thundering in me,
My heart [D]sings
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Pre-Chorus}
[Asus]You've given [Gsus]everything I need,
[Asus]The least I can [Gsus]do is to offer [D]me
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_bridge}
[Bm]Take my life and let it be,
[A]Consecrated, Lord, to [G]thee
Take my moments and my days,
Let them flow in ceaseless [G]praise
{end_of_bridge}

{chorus}

{chorus}
